expected = "Malformed remote validator power must return an ordinary decoding error rather than panic while processing a requested state-sync response. Local constructor invariants must not be assumed for peer protobuf input."
proposal = "In consensus/types/validator_set.go validate individual powers and compute a checked bounded sum on the protobuf path, returning ErrTotalVotingPowerOverflow. Pass an oversized set through real LightBlockFromProto and dispatcher response handling and assert refusal without panic."
